    "GCHD:value_range": [
      0.0,
      100000.0
    ],
    "GCHD:notes": "This layer was produced using records of active volcanoes since 1800 from the Smithsonian Institute-Global Volcanism Program. The Hazard layer has ranks from 0 to 5 with 0 being not within 100km of an active volcano. 0 - 10km: 5, 10 - 30km: 4, 30 - 50km: 3, 50 - 80km: 2, 80 to 100km: 1, > 100km: 0. This layer was developed with significant input from UNICEF's PG Climate team, Prof. Claire Horwell of Durham University and Assoc. Prof. Carol Stewart of the Massey University, New Zealand. Data Source: https://volcano.si.edu/",
